{"segs": ["PA_ja_174:0.4", "PA_ja_174:1.1", "PA_ja_174:1.2"], "en": "4. The Jātaka of the Faithless Monkey “We gave you water in great abundance when you were parched with thirst and tormented by the heat.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_174:1.3"], "en": "“Thus now, having drunk [of this], you cry out;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_174:1.4"], "en": "better is it to have no association with evil people.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_174:2.1"], "en": "“What have you heard or seen?”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_174:2.2"], "en": "\"The one named Sīlavā is a monkey;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_174:2.3"], "en": "now I shall leap down upon him,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_174:2.4"], "en": "for this is our custom.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_174:3.1"], "en": "The Fourth Jātaka: The Story of the Untrustworthy Monkey.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
